# Documentation images under docs/ that scripts/screenshots.py does not make,
# each one reviewed, with the exact sha256 it was reviewed at. bump-version.sh
# fails on a docs/ image that is neither made by that script nor listed here,
# and on a listed one whose bytes changed. Prefer regenerating through
# scripts/screenshots.py (invented data); add or update a line here only after
# reviewing the image. Format: `sha256sum` output from the repo root
# (`sha256sum -c scripts/reviewed-doc-images.sha256` checks it).
